# Secrets and machine-local state never enter an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vercel
.git
graphify-out
cache
reference
docs
.agents
.impeccable
# The web client ships on Vercel and contracts are not built here; keep only
# their manifests so the frozen workspace lockfile still resolves.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
packages/contracts/*
!packages/contracts/package.json
